      "title": {
        "en": "Arriving at Barcelona–El Prat (BCN)"
      },
      "guidance": {
        "en": "L9 Sud serves both airport terminals and connects with other metro lines. Compare the connection to your accommodation, not just the airport station. Some ordinary tickets are not valid at the airport metro gates."
      },
