      "title": {
        "en": "Getting between neighbourhoods"
      },
      "guidance": {
        "en": "Group the Eixample buildings together and plan a separate old-city outing. Park Güell needs its own approach; check TMB’s route information rather than assuming every sight is an easy walk."
